    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "That can't be..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Master can't use a sword anymore ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Was the wound that deep?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "It seems like they're not sure if he'll be able to walk ever again."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Master ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "OTSU, you probably don't understand because you're a woman,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "But Master was born for the sword."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "He's a living sword."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Or so someone said."
    }
